# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This repo deploys to a Linux VPS and runs in Linux Docker containers, but is
# developed on Windows (core.autocrlf=true). Without this, files committed from
# different environments flip between CRLF and LF and every PR shows a
# whole-repo "conflict" that is purely line endings. Forcing LF everywhere keeps
# diffs to real content changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files Git must never touch (never apply EOL conversion).
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
